          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bel urum piny, Nebo gung’; mungu m’araga migi ni wi lim mi ter, man wi lim: gin ma wuyeyo mberembere doko ni ter, ter ni lim m’uol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigung’, girum piny karacelo; gicopo wodho terne ngo, ento gin gigi gicidho i ng’eca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinja, E ot pa Yakobo, ku dong ot mir Israel ceke, m’ayeyogi ugambre kum nyol migi, m’ayeyo ugambre kud i ic; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man cil kum tio an a en, man abiyeyowu cil kum lwar: atimo, man abiyeyo; eyo, abiyeyo, man abibodho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubipora ku ng’a, man wubiketha rom ku ng’a, wubipora ku ng’a, kara wabed calcali? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadi ju ma lalu mola ma kwar kud i usau, man ma poro mola ma tar i mukero, gigamu jabodho mi mola ma kwar ku sukulia, e etimo ni mungu; gipodho piny, eyo, girwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giting’e wi gok, giyeye, man gikethe kakare, e ecungo; eai ungo kud i kakare: eyo, ng’atu moko copo ywak i bang’e, ento ecopo loko lembe ngo, kadi bodhe kud i can pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wupoi kum maeni, man wunyuthru giwu ya wu dhanu; wupoi pire kendo, E wu weg gondri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wupoi kum gin ma kwong’a ma con: kum an a Mungu, man ng’atu mange mbe; an a Mungu, man ng’atu mange mbe ma calu an; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m’ubeyero kajik ugambre i thekri, man ugambre i nindo ma con gin ma fod’utimbre ngo; m’awacu kumae, Lembapora para bicungo, man abitimo gin m’amaru ceke; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m’alwong’o ko winyo ma kwiny ku yo nyangu, ng’atu mi lembapora para kud i ng’om ma bor; eyo, ayero, abiketho etimbre bende; akeco, abitime bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
